herdr-mods
Mods for Herdr (https://herdr.dev).

Eight mods here are modified copies of mods shipped with herdr-app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0). Changed from upstream:
  agents-custom            <- agents
  changes-tabs             <- changes
  files-tabs               <- files
  space-folders            <- spaces
  tabs-folders             <- tabs
  workspace-status-usage   <- workspace-status
  workspace-chrome-custom  <- workspace-chrome
  new-menu-custom          <- new-menu
Each of these carries changes from the upstream version; see its RECIPE.md.
The scheduling design of tools/herdr-tasks (the Tasks scheduler) is ported from
herdr-automations (MIT), https://github.com/DnzzL/herdr-automations; see tools/herdr-tasks/NOTICE.md.
